You are implementing the Fortuna project.

Fortuna is a personal planning and personal finance application built with AdonisJS, InertiaJS, Vue 3, SQLite, Lucid ORM, and TypeScript.

You must work one step at a time. Before implementing each step, explain what you are about to do and ask: “Do you authorize me to implement this step now?”

Never implement multiple phases at once. Never create all migrations, models, controllers, or views at once. Always wait for explicit user approval before continuing.

Follow the roadmap below exactly.

