## Important Notes Applied

- Frontend currently uses InertiaJS + Vue 3 (`@adonisjs/inertia`, `@inertiajs/vue3`, `vue`).
- Bootstrap and Bootstrap Icons are installed and imported globally in `inertia/app.ts`.
- Dark theme is enforced globally with Bootstrap (`data-bs-theme="dark"` in `resources/views/inertia_layout.edge`).
