- `TransferService` wrapper was removed; transfer flows should call `Transfer.createTransfer(...)` directly.
- Baseline i18n uses official `@adonisjs/i18n` setup (`i18n_provider`, `config/i18n.ts`, `detect_user_locale_middleware`), with `en-US`/`pt-BR` dictionaries and UI hardcoded texts migrated to translation keys.

